    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d966">

                <pb facs="0949" n="783" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg783"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 714.1515/30</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Minister of Guatemala
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 96</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-11-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 16, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your note of November 12, expressing your Government’s thanks for the
                    friendly reception accorded to the Special Mission of Guatemala, stating that
                    your Government accepts the mediation offered by the United States in the matter
                    of the boundary dispute between Guatemala and Honduras, and requesting that I
                    recommend to the Government of Honduras that, as a step preliminary to the
                    arbitration, the protocol <pb facs="0950" n="784" xml:id="pg784"/> recently
                    signed by representatives of Guatemala and Honduras be made effective.</p>
                <p>In reply I have the honor to inform you that the Department is giving the
                    contents of your note earnest consideration, and would be glad to receive a copy
                    of the protocol referred to, in order to inform itself as to its terms.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Frank L. Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
